# Security — public surface

## Auth gates

- **Anonymous Auth** may be used for fare estimate (catalog + retail quote).
- **Email OTP** (create account / sign-in) before confirm booking and before loading saved payment methods or corporate settlement.
- Never call staff/admin portal APIs. Use Firebase client + existing callables only.

## Data

- Vehicle classes: public read OK; always filter `isEnabled` + `isVisible` + capacity + trip type.
- Pricing / add-ons: only via authenticated session (including anonymous) or sanitized server paths — do not open full pricing internals to the anonymous web without auth.
- Fare math stays on the server (`buildTripQuote`). Never trust client totals at checkout.
- No service-account keys or Stripe secrets in this app’s client bundle.

## Hygiene

- Validate env with fail-fast helpers; only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` in the browser.
- Do not log PII (addresses, phones, payment refs) to console or analytics.
- Treat user-provided strings as data (no unsanitized HTML).
